  - TxEngine.balance[8192]: 64KB
  - TxEngine.last_nonce[8192]: 64KB
  - TxEngine.nonce_lock[8192]: 8KB

Kernel I/O Layer:
  - CASCore.chunk_map: 1024 × 4KB = 4MB
  - CommitBus: 4096 × 512B = 2MB

Integrity Layer:
  - EpochSnapshot[256]: 256 × 1KB = 256KB
  - DagChainVerifier: 8KB

총 메모리: ~8.5MB
```

